// Layer_Storage_Feature — Storage and Feature Store Layer
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Layer_Storage_Feature".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Layer_Storage_Feature.png
// Ikon: logo produk dari docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (diperiksa 2026-07-11):
//   minio, clickhouse, postgres, mysql, opensearch, qdrant; Valkey tetap icon
//   generik (bukan logo Redis, beda merek fork). Semua edge penyimpanan
//   diarahkan mengikuti arah tulis data (penulis > tempat data mendarat).
// Acuan: subsec:lapisan-data (Subbab IV.4.2, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi);
//   rincian beralat Storage and Feature Store Layer yang memperinci kelompok layanan
//   pada Gambar fig:integrate-service (Subbab IV.2, tanpa alat).
//   Disertakan pada LaTeX sebagai fig:layer-storage-feature.
// Fokus: tiga subgrup berdampingan. Lakehouse {MinIO (+KES), lakeFS, Apache Iceberg,
//   Lakekeeper}, Basis Data {ClickHouse, PostgreSQL (CNPG), MySQL, OpenSearch},
//   Layanan Fitur {Feast, Valkey, Qdrant}. Iceberg > MinIO, lakeFS > MinIO,
//   Lakekeeper > Iceberg, ClickHouse > Feast (sumber offline), Feast > Valkey
//   (materialisasi online), Feast > MinIO (registry berkas), plus batas konsumen.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right): tiga subgrup ditata BERDAMPINGAN
//   (bukan tumpukan vertikal), maksimum dua baris node per grup, agar diagram melebar
//   dan muat pada pita height=0.42\textheight. Disertakan tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.
// Landasan layer: label grup membawa kategori sumbernya (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   yaitu storage and versioning.
// Verifikasi implementasi: semua node ada di platform/components/storage/ (minio,
//   security/kes, lakefs, lakekeeper, clickhouse, cnpg + postgresql, mysql, qdrant,
//   valkey), data-governance/opensearch, model-lifecycle/feast. Iceberg = format
//   tabel primitif yang direalisasikan katalog Lakekeeper di atas MinIO.

direction right

// Produsen keluaran (batas)
Processing Layer [icon: cpu, color: yellow, label: "Processing Layer (Spark, dbt, Flink)"]

// Storage and Feature Store Layer
Storage and Feature Store Layer [icon: database, color: green, label: "Storage and Feature Store Layer (storage and versioning)"] {
  Lakehouse [icon: layers] {
    MinIO [icon: minio, label: "MinIO (objek + KES)"]
    lakeFS [icon: git-branch, label: "lakeFS (versi data)"]
    Iceberg [icon: layers, label: "Apache Iceberg (format tabel)"]
    Lakekeeper [icon: book, label: "Lakekeeper (katalog REST)"]
  }
  Basis Data [icon: database] {
    ClickHouse [icon: clickhouse, label: "ClickHouse (OLAP)"]
    PostgreSQL [icon: postgres, label: "PostgreSQL (CNPG)"]
    MySQL [icon: mysql, label: "MySQL"]
    OpenSearch [icon: opensearch, label: "OpenSearch (log + teks)"]
  }
  Layanan Fitur [icon: package] {
    Feast [icon: package, label: "Feast (feature store)"]
    Valkey [icon: zap, label: "Valkey (online store)"]
    Qdrant [icon: qdrant, label: "Qdrant (indeks vektor)"]
  }
}

// Konsumen (batas)
Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer (konsumen)"]
Governance and Observability Layer [icon: eye, color: teal, label: "Governance and Observability Layer"]

// Alur penyimpanan lakehouse (arah tulis data)
Iceberg > MinIO: berkas tabel pada objek
lakeFS > MinIO: objek versi
Lakekeeper > Iceberg: katalog metadata tabel

// Keluaran pemrosesan mendarat
Processing Layer > Iceberg: tulis tabel batch
Processing Layer > ClickHouse: model gold dan agregasi
Processing Layer > Valkey: fitur stream
Processing Layer > Qdrant: embedding stream

// Alur fitur
ClickHouse > Feast: sumber offline
Feast > Valkey: materialisasi online
Feast > MinIO: registry berkas
Feast > Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer: fitur pelatihan
Valkey > Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer: online feature
Qdrant > Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer: vector feature

// Metadata dan indeks (batas, arah tulis data)
Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer > PostgreSQL: metadata MLflow
Model Lifecycle and Serving Layer > MySQL: metadata Kubeflow Pipelines dan Katib
Governance and Observability Layer > OpenSearch: tulis indeks pencarian
